A pure-Python replacement for GNU ed 1.19, for the minimal images that ship
without ed.

- `pyed/ed.py` — the command (`python3 /app/pyed/ed.py [OPTIONS] [FILE]`)
- `docs/ed.txt` — the GNU ed manual
